# Platform-owned: ctzd sync rewrites this file.
# Cursor hides from its agent every file .gitignore lists, and by default CSV and PNG files too. These are the
# agent's to read: the guidance ctzd writes, and the made-up rows the app's own SQL is faked with.
# .claude/ stays hidden: it holds the same skills as .agents/, for Claude Code.
!/AGENTS.md
!/.agents/
!/.agents/**
!/fixtures/**/*.csv
